        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "The Saudi Proposition",
        "Location": "LOCATION_MIAMI",
        "PublicId": "111891210445",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/miami/scene_flamingo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 4e3a4188-aa48-4bfd-8f03-4ae4b693ba69).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47. It&apos;s a bright day in Miami, where the annual Kronstadt Time Trial Race is being hosted. We have been given a difficult task - eliminate four undercover FBI agents who are running a sting operation on Kronstadt Industries. That isn&apos;t even the hardest part, because the heir apparent to the Saudi throne is present at the event. He is located in the Thwack paddock, while the four others are scattered around the premises. We&apos;ll be working to find out who they are. Good luck, 47.",
